<description>&lt;p&gt;ISIS carried out a suicide bombing at an internal security site in Hasakah, killing two Syrian security force members, while separate attacks in Deir Ezzor and Daraa killed additional security personnel. Drone strikes in Suwayda wounded four security personnel, marking a second drone incident in the region this week. Israel shelled farmland in southwestern Syria, and Iran launched missiles at militants in response to a parade attack. Qatar and Canada reaffirmed support for Syria’s recovery and Palestinian rights. The UCDP recorded 2,732 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMif0FVX3lxTE9zZWhzX3JnN0lod3RuWVhhSzZqRlZ5U2ttWEl2b0UtSzV0QVNjWGMzMVFsbzEtOTFYQjdxNG1EVmpvRVFRNDk1TlEtOEw0S0R4ZU1IMGZ0ck15MU55c1ZqakFvazFJdTlZSURpdmNUWnlwemFVY3BIMkpweXh3WnM?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwwFBVV95cUxQdDhPbGhxdzJYWW5lbmNiTmVmUDlPUUxldlFRRTNfcDlxZzhSd2ExOE5SNkZDOHJ2eks5LTkzQ0tySk9CbFpFenI1cHNmdGpfY2czWnp6dktJMm84Sjdyc21oMFpoaG9BVVNyeFZOanZSekZFdzg4aG4wUWpSTk5tT3VHbEJxdkRhV0dzWEVoWDRYeVFuWm5nZU15TkhRWENZM1AtOWpmZGdjUHptUDhfWGc0RG9aY3RNVS1QcXJYc3RvVFk?oc=5&quot;&gt;Arab News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirAFBVV95cUxNa3VxSFZ6RjhpRl93dmcwUVpkLTFxYlJhZF9QNVd6LVBjYVZRbnBlWU95cU5OMFdxWUlvM0hEYkRoZFdKR2lTMVpFaXYxYjlld1hZcG9OYlZITUtpRE53WDhJb0hMRGtUTWNIYVBLOElHUmN1TzZYM0lRZ0tnTG82T3ZkOXJYQXhydHNKTmNqWkJIMm9waWtjWXhNekhCaXBaaFNRd2RDdE9iVjRx?oc=5&quot;&gt;Anadolu Ajansı&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;NewsCord&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Anadolu Ajansı&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Demócrata&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMix